	"data": "2026-09-30\n\nEvents\nChris named the three dimensions of play-bleed: time (lingering, frequency, recency), experience (what you did at the node — read, write, build, fail), and personality (your specific traversal path colors the node's meaning). Same node, different residue per person. This is why play-bleed requires 3D space as medium — spatial traversal is inherently continuous and directional in ways graph data structures aren't. The path IS the data. Connects to Star OS: play-bleed as a…",
